      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_13da1476a26cb527fa19b1fb44b58787ff3c0dd82d0fde8e28160068b46c4340"
      ],
      "text": "During meetings the app offers dual-channel transcription, live AI assist suggestions, conversation metrics (talk ratio, WPM, monologue detection), coaching nudges, MCP auto-triggering, and bookmarking."
    },
