      "text": "Recording is supported on macOS 12+ (Apple Silicon and Intel) and Windows x64; Linux and Windows ARM64 builds run the UI, MCP servers, workflows, history, and exports but reject recording because no capture binary exists, and no hosted Windows installer is published."
