      ],
      "text": "The main process contains a copilot service layer with context-manager, conversation-metrics, nudge-engine, sales-copilot orchestrator, summary-generator, and transcript-buffer services, plus an MCP orchestration set including intent-detector and tool-aggregator services."
    },
