      "text": "The stack includes Electron 42, TypeScript 5.8, React 19, Tailwind with shadcn/ui, tRPC 11 over a Hono HTTP server, Drizzle ORM with SQLite, Zustand, VideoDB SDK 0.3.0, MCP SDK 1.0.0, OpenAI SDK 6.19.0, and Vite."
